    "formula": "3-fold inner OOF corrected Kumo on6k; fit a,b by meanBCE(a+b*logit(p_inner))+.02/2*(a^2+(b-1)^2), a in[-.5,.5], b in[.5,1.5]; pK=sigmoid(z25+.5*(a+(b-1)*z25)); final=.75*pK+.25*spline77",
